            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "dQkeg",
              "name": "Article Body",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 20,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "LxWJq",
                  "name": "h1",
                  "fill": "#2C2520",
                  "content": "前言",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 20,
                  "fontWeight": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "gGXAO",
                  "name": "p1",
                  "fill": "#5C5147",
                  "content": "最近在做一个多主题切换的需求，研究了各种方案后，最终选择了 CSS 变量 + Tailwind 的组合方案。本文将详细介绍从零实现多主题切换的完整过程，包括设计思路、技术选型和踩坑经验。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.8,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "JHVCk",
                  "name": "h2",
                  "fill": "#2C2520",
                  "content": "技术选型",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 20,
                  "fontWeight": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "DoRrG",
                  "name": "p2",
                  "fill": "#5C5147",
                  "content": "目前主流的多主题方案有以下几种：CSS 变量方案、CSS-in-JS 方案（如 styled-components）、Tailwind CSS 原生支持的 dark mode、以及通过 class 切换的方案。经过对比分析，CSS 变量 + Tailwind 的方案在性能和开发体验上达到了最好的平衡。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.8,
